## Interface: 16001
## Title: RollFrames
## Notes: Group loot rolls, live, in a Blizzard-style window: everyone's Need, Greed or Pass as it happens, roll numbers, who's still deciding, the winner, and a compact history. Optional Need/Greed/Pass buttons. Light enough for 40-man raid nights.
